  <item>
    <title>005: 旅伴决定心态！南极与船友体验人生美好，大马因爸妈深夜内耗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c75d80bf52a16cd18ea23a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c75d80bf52a16cd18ea23a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Mar 2025 20:44:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><br></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjGS6ybYZV7LyvoBukuXz76lBy45.jpeg"></figure><span></span><h2><span>本期播客话题：旅伴旅游</span></h2><span></span><p><span>主播：郭子·男低｜酱酱·钢伴</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：黄桃·女高｜咖喱·男低｜边边·女中</span></p><span></span><p><span>合唱团的小伙伴们都非常喜欢全球旅行，今年年初已经有一批热爱生活的他们旅游归来，这次会为我们带来什么故事呢？他们各自的旅伴又是谁呢？大家旅途中的开心与烦恼都已记录在本集播客，欢迎大家点击收听💜</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="272">04:32</a> 南极圈的划分规则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 我人生的第一次冬泳是在南极！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="897">14:57</a> 与74岁大爷共同演绎《斯卡布罗集市》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1084">18:04</a> 没有网络会让大家更能关注到自己内心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1254">20:54</a> 雨季前往大马，可见度超烂！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1428">23:48</a> 大汗山热带雨林徒步，老妈惊叹：哇～还是外国人开放哇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 大p人的我为了每天行程焦虑得不行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1817">30:17</a> 带爸妈出去玩后，他们都开始有了变化</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fog5IgLEUkhJ0lQ2_f2hvwrCIX_s.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlZHw0uaEHOLou6vpT815YpMJriz.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkHRLetjvqDgO7Gl-3mEimSZMOpL.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>·黄桃于南极拍摄的照片</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrV58eEKw8Oo2k8R7ZNlwCilnl4R.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmJy5knBpuZvqWtJ0aU8zd1XMkMp.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>·咖喱与爸妈热带雨林穿行</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：郭子</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：郭子、咖喱</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：郭子</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频处理：郭子</span></p><span></span><p><span>单集封面制作：英俊</span></p><span></span><p><span>插曲：我团演绎版本《宫崎骏动画电影音乐集》</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：酱酱</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作：guohaoranb@outlook.com</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsuoyXQi15rEW9dvMqKVm3vd2PqI.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
