    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c085d705a90dfd0d4ddc63</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Feb 2025 16:02:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjGS6ybYZV7LyvoBukuXz76lBy45.jpeg"></figure><span></span><h2><span>本期播客话题：家乡味</span></h2><span></span><p><span>主播：郭子·男低｜酱酱·钢伴</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：元宝·女中｜Lance·男高｜宇鹅·男低</span></p><span></span><p><span>第四期接上我们的第三期！在今年过年前我团的一次专场演出后，合唱团员们相聚一堂把酒当歌，宴会上不知什么由头大家开始通过省会接龙的方式唱起自己的家乡歌曲来，民歌、调子、酒歌、方言版流行歌曲等等等等，就连饭店的老板听得也直拍手叫好。这期我们将重现当日场景，把每个合唱团员们深入骨髓的味道及旋律一同分享给大家，欢迎大家点击收听🩵</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 元宝推荐的武汉菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="428">07:08</a> 《汉阳门花园》我团演绎版本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">12:18</a> Lance推荐的浙江温州菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1014">16:54</a> 浙江话《阿妹》纠人心弦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a> 宇鹅推荐的贵州菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> 山歌《瞎子》感人至深</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlgCbHwvJl6copN4a3S9CFNLlX9x.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>·武汉的吊子</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlTAsEOneMcngjqxVbG_Sd7o4pG-.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>·武汉烤蟹柳、烤粉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuyiLsCiKfow-4ujExW091n7S4JM.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>·Lance自己做的鱼饼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvz1cnaQSodOQ60vx5HE2qnkH3kn.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>·蛋包炒洋芋</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：郭子、酱酱</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：郭子、酱酱</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：郭子</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频处理：郭子</span></p><span></span><p><span>单集封面制作：英俊</span></p><span></span><p><span>插曲：《汉阳门花园》我团演绎版本</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：酱酱</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作：guohaoranb@outlook.com</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsuoyXQi15rEW9dvMqKVm3vd2PqI.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
